{"id":"cd4ceead6b210901","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-hornpi.md","title":"Prime implicants of Horn functions are Horn","display":"thm-hornpi — Prime implicants of Horn functions are Horn","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-hornpi","aliases":["27-thm-hornpi"],"display":"thm-hornpi — Prime implicants of Horn functions are Horn","depends_on":["[[27-df-hornfunc]]","[[27-df-purehorn]]","[[27-df-hornterm]]","[[27-df-piset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-hornpi"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-hornpi</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hornpi — Prime implicants of Horn functions are Horn"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a42b2c2b11efeb04\" href=\"?note=a42b2c2b11efeb04\" title=\"27-df-purehorn\">27-df-purehorn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c89910355a420355\" href=\"?note=c89910355a420355\" title=\"27-df-hornterm\">27-df-hornterm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i(a)=a_i\">\\(x_i(a)=a_i\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x_i(a)=1-a_i\">\\(\\bar x_i(a)=1-a_i\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[n]\">\\(i\\in[n]\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_L\">\\(T_L\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lits}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lits}\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornTerm}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornTerm}_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PureHornTerm}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PureHornTerm}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}\\)</span> are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a42b2c2b11efeb04\" href=\"?note=a42b2c2b11efeb04\" title=\"27-df-purehorn\">27-df-purehorn</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c89910355a420355\" href=\"?note=c89910355a420355\" title=\"27-df-hornterm\">27-df-hornterm</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\;\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\subseteq\\mathrm{HornTerm}_n\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\\;\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\subseteq\\mathrm{PureHornTerm}_n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\;\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\subseteq\\mathrm{HornTerm}_n\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\\;\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\subseteq\\mathrm{PureHornTerm}_n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.1, Theorem 6.2，印刷页 271，PDF 第 295 页（从 1 计数）。 原书实际命题远强于旧节点的通用删字性质；旧 Remark “Horn 素蕴涵项可含多个负文字”在本书约定下错误。已核对原书的 consensus 保持 Horn/pure Horn 论证；完整 consensus 完备性由原书 Theorem 3.5 提供，本节点未重证该一般定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-hornfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-purehorn","status":"resolved","id":"a42b2c2b11efeb04","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-purehorn]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornterm","status":"resolved","id":"c89910355a420355","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-hornterm]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x_i(a)=a_i$, $\\bar x_i(a)=1-a_i$ for $i\\in[n]$, $a\\in\\mathbb B^n$; $\\mathrm{Lit}_n$, $\\mathrm{Term}_n$, $T_L$ and $\\mathrm{Lits}$ are as in [[27-df-litset]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$, $\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$, $\\mathrm{HornTerm}_n$, $\\mathrm{PureHornTerm}_n$ and $\\mathrm{PI}$ are defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]], [[27-df-purehorn]], [[27-df-hornterm]] and [[27-df-piset]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-purehorn","status":"resolved","id":"a42b2c2b11efeb04","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$, $\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$, $\\mathrm{HornTerm}_n$, $\\mathrm{PureHornTerm}_n$ and $\\mathrm{PI}$ are defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]], [[27-df-purehorn]], [[27-df-hornterm]] and [[27-df-piset]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornterm","status":"resolved","id":"c89910355a420355","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$, $\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$, $\\mathrm{HornTerm}_n$, $\\mathrm{PureHornTerm}_n$ and $\\mathrm{PI}$ are defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]], [[27-df-purehorn]], [[27-df-hornterm]] and [[27-df-piset]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","loca